"config_property_copy_button:+++quarkus.lra.devservices.service-name+++[]"
msgstr ""

msgid "The value of the `quarkus-dev-service-lra-coordinator` label attached to the started container. This property is used when `shared` is set to `true`. In this case, before starting a container, Dev Services for LRA coordinator looks for a container with the `quarkus-dev-service-lra-coordinator` label set to the configured value. If found, it will use this container instead of starting a new one. Otherwise, it starts a new container with the `quarkus-dev-service-lra-coordinator` label set to the specified value."
